From 02892e925e18df3bbb9e2c915c61d7c23ba9a192 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Suresh, Prashanth" <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 04:31:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] media-driver: Link libcutils for property_get() in
 media_libva.cpp

A real flashfiles build failed to link iHD_drv_video.so: undefined
symbol property_get, referenced from
DdiMedia_SelectIntelDevice()/media_libva.cpp:1613.

The earlier fork-restoration commit (662b5d7af, restoring the
dGPU/iGPU device-selection logic discarded by the version-bump
overlay) added property_get()/<cutils/properties.h> usage but never
added libcutils to iHD_drv_video's shared_libs -- the header resolved
fine (already reachable without it), so the gap only surfaced at link
time, not compile time.

Added libcutils alongside the existing libutils/liblog.

Tracked-On: NIACP3-1547
Signed-off-by: Suresh, Prashanth <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
---
 Android.bp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index db500ea0a..f0d48f46e 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -2058,6 +2058,7 @@ cc_library_shared {
     shared_libs: [
         "libsync",
         "libutils",
+        "libcutils",
         "libdrm",
         "libva",
         "liblog",
-- 
2.34.1

